<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia sees bumper sugar crop, weak price.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia sees bumper sugar crop, weak price.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland's 1996/97 sugarcane harvest is drawing to a close and should record a bumper crop, growers organisation Canegrowers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sugar production in 1996/97 has surpassed the record 4.68 million tonnes produced in the previous year, it said.</p>
<p>Lower world sugar prices and a strong Australian dollar have diminished returns for growers, however, the group said.</p>
<p>Queensland produces more than 95 percent of Australia's sugar.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
